    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dublin Homes Auctioneers is pleased to present No. 74 Rosanule, a beautifully presented, second floor 2 bed modern apartment ideally located within the ever-popular Phoenix Park Racecourse development. The property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is in turn key condition. The property has been upgraded and boasts wood panelling in the hallway, refurbished ensuite, composite decking and new water pump.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a spacious and light-filled kitchen/ living/dining room, with access to one of the two balconies. On the other side of the apartment is the master bedroom with access to a private balcony, ensuite, 2nd bedroom and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe apartment benefits from a designated parking space in the underground car park and is surrounded by well-maintained communal surroundings, all within a quiet, family-friendly setting.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned adjacent to Phoenix Park, one of Europe’s largest enclosed public parks, the location offers an abundance of recreational amenities including walking and cycling trails. The area is exceptionally well connected, with easy access to the N3 and M50 road networks, while frequent public transport links provide swift access to Dublin City Centre. Ashtown train station is within a 7 minute walk, with Dublin Airport 15 minutes by car. On site facilities include a convenience store, coffee shop, hairdresser, pharmacy and creche. A range of supermarkets, bars, restaurants, schools, cafés, and leisure facilities are all within close proximity, including Blanchardstown Centre. Castleknock Village and Rathbourne Village are all just a short stroll from the property.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a modern, low-maintenance home in a highly sought-after and convenient residential development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway 4.48m x 3.33m\r\nKitchen 2.37m x 2.66m\r\nDining & Living Room 8.6m x 5.67m\r\nMain Bedroom 5.43m x 2.70m\r\nEnsuite 1.25m x 2.21m\r\n2nd Bedroom 3.81m x 3.02m\r\nMain Bathroom 2.09m x 1.58m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Bright 2nd floor dual - aspect apartment with natural light throughout the day\r\nTurnkey condition\r\nB2 BER rating - eligible for green mortgage\r\nTwo double bedrooms with built in wardrobes\r\nTwo bathrooms (recently renovated ensuite)\r\nTwo balconies (sunny south east facing main balcony with composite decking)\r\nStorage room\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nAlu - clad double glazed windows\r\nHardwood flooring in the hallway and living room\r\nLift access\r\nOwner occupied with no onward chain, no rent cap\r\nNew water pump and new electrical appliances in kitchen\r\nDesignated underground parking with EV charging and ample visitor spaces throughout the development\r\nVideo - phone intercom and fully alarmed\r\nLandscaped communal gardens"
      },
      {
